<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="arial">{!Lead.FirstName},</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Since you downloaded the e-book we published on real estate investing outside of your own local market through Bigger Pockets recently, I only have one question for you:&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b><u>Are you just looking for education, or are you serious about building a passive income portfolio?</u></b></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Aside from publishing free content for newbie investors from time to time, our company, <a href="http://www.memphisinvest.com" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font color="#3333ff">Memphis Invest</font></a>, is the largest and (few would argue) the most respected turnkey company in the country. <font color="#3333ff"><a href="http://www.memphisinvest.com/turnkey/passive-income-jumpstart-package?hsCtaTracking=0fc21674-3e2e-447d-8cd8-b4f9f1ef7e48%7Cab3843e5-34d9-4e86-8761-1fc36ed54d13&amp;__hstc=77998027.0e9a112dee6cfd3379e21b0f8df13c2f.1471613800805.1487196209045.1487200310661.35&amp;__hssc=77998027.1.1487200310661&amp;__hsfp=3466644470">You can see 16 short videos right here</a> </font>where our owners discuss their investment strategies and how we assist investors to achieve long term wealth.</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Offering rehabbed and rented single family properties in 5 of the best markets in the U.S. for buy and hold investors, we currently manage 4800+ properties for 1500 investors from all over the world.</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">We offer cash flowing properties between $100-200k in Memphis, Dallas, Houston, Little Rock and Oklahoma City.&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">We operate in these specific markets because of the affordable price point for available inventory, the high rent-to-price ratio of these markets, and because these states all have very friendly landlord laws.&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">If you are serious about beginning to build your real estate portfolio, <a href="https://my-schedule.timetrade.com/app/td-1259187/workflows/44ryg/schedule/availability?wfsid=16a5bdc5-baba97f6-16a5bdbe-baba97f6-00000002-oka5q9fn4r31ljbqv2h2scm5sidj6qbn&amp;view=full&amp;fs=1">your next step is to click right here to schedule a call with me</a>. I'll be happy to help you figure out if we are a good fit for you as a company, and if you are a good fit for us as a client.</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Take care.</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Rick</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: small;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</span></div><div class="gmail_signature" data-smartmail="gmail_signature" style="font-size: small;"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><br><div><span style="border-collapse: separate;"><div><font face="verdana, sans-serif"><b>Rick Luebbert</b></font></div><div style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: georgia, serif;"><span style="font-family: verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;"><font color="#000000">Memphis Invest, GP</font></span></div><div style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: georgia, serif;"><span style="font-family: verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;"><font color="#000000"><br></font></span></div></span><div style="font-family: arial, sans-serif;"><div style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34);"><img src="https://ci6.googleusercontent.com/proxy/P-ZUATG-9KvjtTCYPKyMYZvbZ1icP24mB3AQG8FiodVo-sdJ2JgTowsNbAbkh7l2lFLFbGwo2IeCTAWCabhVQv1K4a8rul-WiunKnoxlWZI0uzWqL8S3lDRln2IqOfbrtqKAikZg-5guzwjsB7ufNvHZ26--Z-xThtVQ2w=s0-d-e1-ft#http://info.memphisinvest.com/hs-fs/hub/44341/file-2286025665-png/Memphis-Invest-Logo-email-footer.png"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34);"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34);"><font face="arial" size="2"><b style="border-collapse: separate; line-height: 24px;"><font color="#1155cc"><a href="https://my-schedule.timetrade.com/app/td-1259187/workflows/44ryg/schedule/availability?wfsid=16a5bdc5-baba97f6-16a5bdbe-baba97f6-00000002-oka5q9fn4r31ljbqv2h2scm5sidj6qbn&amp;view=full&amp;fs=1">CLICK HERE TO SCHEDULE A 15 MINUTE CALL WITH ME</a></font></b></font></div><div style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34);"><font face="arial" size="2"><b style="border-collapse: separate; line-height: 24px;"><font color="#1155cc"><a href="https://my-schedule.timetrade.com/app/td-1259187/workflows/44ryg/schedule/availability?wfsid=16a5bdc5-baba97f6-16a5bdbe-baba97f6-00000002-oka5q9fn4r31ljbqv2h2scm5sidj6qbn&amp;view=full&amp;fs=1">THIS WEEK!</a></font></b></font></div><div style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34);"><span style="font-family: georgia, serif; border-collapse: separate;"><font color="#f26522" size="1" style="font-family: verdana, sans-serif;">T</font><font color="#000000" size="1" style="font-family: verdana, sans-serif;">: +901.628.5959</font></span><br></div><div style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); border-collapse: separate; font-family: georgia, serif;"><font size="1" style="font-family: verdana, sans-serif;">F</font><font size="1" style="font-family: verdana, sans-serif;">: +901.201.5803</font></div><div style="border-collapse: separate; font-family: georgia, serif;"><font color="#f26522" size="1" style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: verdana, sans-serif;">E</font><font color="#000000" size="1" style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: verdana, sans-serif;">:</font><font size="1" style="font-family: verdana, sans-serif;"> <font color="#3333ff">rick<a href="mailto:brett@memphisinvest.com" target="_blank">@memphisinvest.com</a></font></font><font size="1" style="font-family: verdana, sans-serif;" color="#3333ff"><br><font><a href="http://www.memphisinvest.com/" target="_blank">http://www.MemphisInvest.com</a></font></font></div><div style="border-collapse: separate; font-family: georgia, serif;"><font size="1" style="font-family: verdana, sans-serif;" color="#000099">&nbsp;</font></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>]]></td>
